# KidVerse AI — Permanent Project Memory

## Wrapper Brand
- **Product name:** KidVerse AI
- **Purpose:** COPPA-compliant, parent-managed multi-realm launcher for kid-safe AI adventures
- **Stack:** React Native with Expo (TypeScript), Expo Router (v58+ file-based routing), Supabase (PostgreSQL + Deno Edge Functions)
- **Greenfield only:** Do NOT connect, reference, or reuse any existing adult roleplay databases, prompts, or codebases (including NexusAI / Janitor-style projects in this monorepo). KidVerse AI is 100% standalone.

## Three Age-Calibrated Sub-Apps ("Realms")

### 1. `ages_5_7` — StorySprout
- Voice-first picture adventure
- Auto Text-to-Speech (`expo-speech`) read-aloud every turn
- Giant microphone button for voice input
- Oversized icon-driven choice cards
- 1–2 sentence kindergarten / 1st-grade narration
- Zero fail states

### 2. `ages_8_9` — RealmHopper
- Interactive quest & puzzle adventure
- 3 action-choice buttons + free voice/text input
- Collectible backpack inventory
- Riddles
- 2–4 sentence 3rd–4th grade chapter narration
- Modular Build-a-Hero preset selector (Archetype + Sidekick + Quest Goal)

### 3. `ages_10_12` — FableForge
- Middle-grade adventure RPG & world-builder
- Multi-step quests, character stats/gear, quest log
- Modular hero/world builder (Archetype + Sidekick + Quest Goal)
- Strict G-rated guardrails

## COPPA & Zero-PII Policy
- Never collect emails, real names, birthdates, locations, or photos from child profiles
- Store only parent-approved fields: `nickname` (from safe presets), `avatar_id`, `age_tier`, `daily_message_limit`, and game state
- All parent tools sit behind a PIN-protected Parent Gate
- No third-party tracking SDKs on child surfaces

## Multi-Layer Safety Pipeline
Every AI turn MUST execute server-side in this order:
1. **Pre-LLM Input / PII Filter** — scrub profanity, violence, mature themes, and PII; deflect gently in-character if flagged
2. **Non-Overridable Age-Calibrated G-Rated System Prompt** — hardcoded per `age_tier`, with anti-prompt-injection instructions (client cannot override)
3. **Structured JSON Output** — narration, companion_dialogue, choices, state_update
4. **Post-LLM Safety Validation** — validate and sanitize before returning JSON to the client

## App Structure (canonical)
- `/app/_layout.tsx` — root layout + dynamic Realm theme provider
- `/app/index.tsx` — KidVerse AI Wrapper Launcher (kid profile cards + Parent Gate)
- `/app/realm/[tier].tsx` — Dynamic Realm Hub
- `/app/play/[sessionId].tsx` — Adaptive Adventure Engine
- `/app/parent.tsx` — PIN-protected Parent Dashboard
- `/supabase/migrations/` — COPPA schema + RLS
- `/supabase/functions/realm-turn/` — safety + turn Edge Function

## Design & UX Guardrails
- Bright, playful, age-appropriate visual themes that shift per Realm
- No dark-mode-first adult UI patterns, no purple-glow “AI chatbot” aesthetics borrowed from adult products
- Accessibility: large tap targets for StorySprout; readable type scales per Realm
